{"id":"olvidado","lemma":"olvidado","pos":"adj","rank":928,"glosses":["forgotten"],"ipa":"/olbiˈdado/","forms":{"feminine":"olvidada","masculinePlural":"olvidados","femininePlural":"olvidadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/25/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-olvidado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Te has olvidado?","en":"Did you forget?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/71006","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"¿Se te ha olvidado algo?","en":"Did you forget something?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65356","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"something, anything"}]},{"text":"¿Ya me has olvidado?","en":"Have you already forgotten me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581570","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"Se me había olvidado totalmente.","en":"I completely forgot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730528","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},null,{"g":"totally"}]},{"text":"La tragedia de la guerra no debe ser olvidada.","en":"The tragedy of war must not be forgotten.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"tragedy, catastrophe"},null,null,{"g":"war, warfare"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to be"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]}]}